8
00:00:32,933 --> 00:00:35,400
Wake up. Wake up.

9
00:00:46,967 --> 00:00:49,200
I'm fine. I'm okay.

10
00:00:49,233 --> 00:00:53,033
Out on the street, one place was lit up.

11
00:00:55,867 --> 00:00:56,567
I ran toward it.

12
00:00:56,633 --> 00:00:57,433
You thought...

13
00:01:00,033 --> 00:01:01,800
I thought this would save you.

14
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,067
But I didn't know you were...

15
00:01:03,067 --> 00:01:04,400
It's like a...

16
