Like a fish tank.

17
00:01:10,567 --> 00:01:16,833
You're swimming in there.

18
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,100
I can't swim.

19
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,167
Can't swim.

20
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,300
So he...

21
00:01:29,433 --> 00:01:30,800
Could you teach me?

22
00:01:33,933 --> 00:01:35,533
[Indistinct whispering]

23
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:42,200
