24
00:01:43,767 --> 00:01:45,000
Help me.

25
00:01:45,267 --> 00:01:45,667
Thank you.

26
00:01:45,667 --> 00:01:47,033
To repay you.

27
00:01:54,633 --> 00:01:55,233
Mm.

28
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,600
What are you thanking me for?

29
00:02:01,067 --> 00:02:02,100
What are you thanking me for?

30
00:02:02,133 --> 00:02:03,267
Want to come over?

31
00:02:03,267 --> 00:02:04,100
No, no.

32
