37
00:02:12,567 --> 00:02:13,200
Why?

38
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,400
I'm afraid to go.

39
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,133
Maybe later.

40
00:02:16,133 --> 00:02:17,300
You don't usually drink, do you?

41
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:18,733
