45
00:02:23,167 --> 00:02:23,733
Thank you.

46
00:02:23,767 --> 00:02:25,167
Go get some ice, then pour the drinks.

47
00:02:25,167 --> 00:02:26,733
I'll lie on your lap.

48
00:02:26,733 --> 00:02:27,400
Okay.

49
00:02:29,167 --> 00:02:31,233
