and you're already lying down.

50
00:02:31,233 --> 00:02:32,567
Ha! All right.

51
00:02:32,567 --> 00:02:33,967
Grown-ups need to play too.

52
00:02:33,967 --> 00:02:36,567
But we didn't mean playing games.

53
00:02:36,567 --> 00:02:39,900
Not video games or arcades.

54
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:42,533
Not sightseeing together either.

55
00:02:42,533 --> 00:02:44,033
Just running around the neighborhood.

56
00:02:44,033 --> 00:02:46,633
