90
00:03:49,833 --> 00:03:53,233
Then suddenly: "You're Zhuangzhuang!"

91
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:54,800
She recognized me.

92
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,700
I was so moved.

93
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,833
And she wouldn't take my money.

94
00:03:57,833 --> 00:03:59,633
