97
00:04:04,967 --> 00:04:07,167
Even she looked exactly the same.

98
00:04:07,167 --> 00:04:08,900
I could barely hold it together.

99
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:10,767
After that, I was afraid to see her.

100
00:04:10,767 --> 00:04:12,767
I thought she'd give me things again.

101
00:04:12,767 --> 00:04:14,767
Love comes through at other moments.

102
00:04:14,767 --> 00:04:16,233
It was there in that moment too.

103
00:04:16,267 --> 00:04:18,633
But sex and love are separate,

104
00:04:18,633 --> 00:04:19,867
