105
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:26,700
I often wonder why I can't love.

106
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,533
Nobody...

107
00:04:32,167 --> 00:04:34,167
Nobody taught us how to love.

108
00:04:35,933 --> 00:04:37,533
Can it be taught?

109
00:04:39,967 --> 00:04:46,700
It takes steady perseverance.

110
00:04:48,067 --> 00:04:50,700
Never abandoning, never giving up. And...

111
00:04:51,967 --> 00:04:53,167
Feeling secure.

112
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:57,967
You have to feel secure to love someone.

113
00:05:01,067 --> 00:05:02,433
