119
00:05:11,433 --> 00:05:12,167
Mm.

120
00:05:13,833 --> 00:05:14,533
Now...

121
00:05:16,167 --> 00:05:18,400
In high school, I'd skip class to watch sunsets here.

122
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:19,933
Oh, beautiful.

123
00:05:19,933 --> 00:05:20,767
I watched the sunset here every day.

124
00:05:20,767 --> 00:05:21,133
Beautiful.

125
00:05:21,133 --> 00:05:22,800
A time we can't return to.

126
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:25,133
But you can't live there forever.

127
00:05:25,133 --> 00:05:27,333
You can't keep looking back.

128
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,833
I was wrong.

129
00:05:28,833 --> 00:05:31,267
I was wrong. I was wrong.

130
00:05:31,733 --> 00:05:33,000
I was wrong.

131
00:05:35,067 --> 00:05:36,300
I was wrong.

132
