258
00:13:03,267 --> 00:13:03,600
Mm.

259
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,000
There is no "if."

260
00:13:06,133 --> 00:13:07,033
There is no "if."

261
00:13:07,033 --> 00:13:09,300
