268
00:13:29,533 --> 00:13:31,667
So cold. So cold.

269
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:42,700
Do you know?

270
00:13:43,667 --> 00:13:44,567
Do you know?

271
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:53,800
People who freeze to death...
